<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/general/head') %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- prettier-ignore -->
    <header class="about-header">
  <!-- prettier-ignore -->
  <%- include('./partials/general/navbar.ejs') %>
  <section class="container about-section">
    <div class="product-description content scroll-fade-up">
      <h1>Our Products</h1>
      <p class="text-product">
        Discover the essence of Apulia in every drop of our extra virgin olive
        oil. Crafted with care and tradition, our oils bring the rich flavors of
        sun-kissed olives to your table. Explore our selection and elevate your
        culinary creations with the pure taste of Italy.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="linea scroll-fade-up"></div>
    <div class="flex-about">
      <div class="about-img scroll-fade-up">
        <img
          class="img-about"
          src="../image/OliveInMano.webp"
          alt="Hand holding olives - Promontolio organic olive oil"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="about-text scroll-fade-up">
        <h1>Our Heritage</h1>
        <p>
          Nestled on Apulia’s sun-drenched slopes, our family has harvested
          olives for generations. Each grove whispers tales of ancestral hands,
          sea breezes, and limestone soils that shape our oil’s character. We
          honor this lineage by preserving traditional methods passed down
          through centuries.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-about">
      <div class="about-text scroll-fade-up">
        <h1>Our Mission</h1>
        <p>
          Our mission is to craft extra virgin olive oil that embodies
          authenticity, health, and environmental stewardship. We marry
          time-honored practices with modern eco-friendly techniques to deliver
          pure flavor and protect the land for future generations.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-img scroll-fade-up">
        <img
          class="img-about"
          src="../image/GarganoMare.webp"
          alt="Gargano sea view - Promontolio olive oil"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</header>
    <section class="about-section-2">
      <div class="content">
        <div class="flex-about">
          <div class="about-text scroll-fade-up">
            <h1>Our Values</h1>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Authenticity:</strong> Honoring centuries-old traditions
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Sustainability:</strong> Solar-powered mills and water
                recycling
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Transparency:</strong> Full traceability from tree to
                table
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Community:</strong> Supporting local workers and
                artisans
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Health:</strong> Rich in polyphenols and antioxidants
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-text scroll-fade-up">
            <h1>Craftsmanship & Process</h1>
            <p>
              Hand-picked at dawn and cold-pressed within hours, every olive
              goes through rigorous tasting panels and acidity tests. Our mill
              runs on solar power, and we use natural compost to nourish the
              soil. The result is an oil with vibrant green hues, peppery
              finish, and unmatched freshness.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-container scroll-fade-up">
          <a class="btn-main" href="">Buy Promontolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/general/footer') %>
  </body>
</html>
